{"id":"285deaa50ea04329","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-first-order-semantics.md","title":"Set Structures and Satisfaction","display":"df-first-order-semantics — Set Structures and Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-first-order-semantics","aliases":["68-df-first-order-semantics"],"display":"df-first-order-semantics — Set Structures and Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[68-df-first-order-syntax]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§11 pp.33-34 / PDF 42-43; explicit set-based satisfaction recursion","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-first-order-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-first-order-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-semantics — Set Structures and Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83dddcd7f37b01bd\" href=\"?note=83dddcd7f37b01bd\" title=\"68-df-first-order-syntax\">68-df-first-order-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11 pp.33-34 / PDF 42-43; explicit set-based satisfaction recursion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\sigma\">\\(M,\\sigma\\)</span> 为候选集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Signature}\">\\(\\operatorname{Signature}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Term}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Term}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Form}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Form}_{68}\\)</span> 和语法构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83dddcd7f37b01bd\" href=\"?note=83dddcd7f37b01bd\" title=\"68-df-first-order-syntax\">68-df-first-order-syntax</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{68}\">\\(D_{68}\\)</span> 及语义函数图在下式引入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta)\\)</span> 是对任意候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,p,\\eta\">\\(M,p,\\eta\\)</span> 定义的谓词。</p>\n<p>语义递归条款固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)\">\\(\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)\">\\(M=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\)</span>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in D^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\eta\\in D^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)\">\\(s,t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\operatorname{Form}_{68}(\\sigma)\">\\(p,q\\in\\operatorname{Form}_{68}(\\sigma)\\)</span>。函数应用条款的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in J\">\\(j\\in J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)^{\\beta(j)}\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)^{\\beta(j)}\\)</span>；关系应用条款的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)^{\\alpha(i)}\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)^{\\alpha(i)}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{68}^{M}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{68}^{M}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}\">\\(\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}\\)</span> 是函数图；对非法结构候选，其图取空集，而非对非法输入指定某个数学真值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists I,J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^I\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^J\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)\\land\\operatorname{Signature}(\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D\\;\\left(D\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\exists\\rho\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal P(D^r)\\right)^I\\;\n\\exists\\phi\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}D^{D^r}\\right)^J\\;\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;M=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\rho(i)\\subseteq D^{\\alpha(i)})\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall j\\in J\\;(\\phi(j)\\in D^{D^{\\beta(j)}})\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists I,J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^I\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^J\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)\\land\\operatorname{Signature}(\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D\\;\\left(D\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\exists\\rho\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal P(D^r)\\right)^I\\;\n\\exists\\phi\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}D^{D^r}\\right)^J\\;\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;M=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\rho(i)\\subseteq D^{\\alpha(i)})\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall j\\in J\\;(\\phi(j)\\in D^{D^{\\beta(j)}})\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{68}(M):=\\begin{cases}\nD&amp;M=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi),\\ \\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma),\\\\\n\\varnothing&amp;\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\;\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{68}(M):=\\begin{cases}\nD&amp;M=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi),\\ \\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma),\\\\\n\\varnothing&amp;\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\;\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\;\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\bigr)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{val}_{68}^{M}=\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}=\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\;\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\bigr)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{val}_{68}^{M}=\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}=\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{val}_{68}^{M}\\in D_{68}(M)^{\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)\\times D_{68}(M)^{\\mathbb N}}\\land\n\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\operatorname{Form}_{68}(\\sigma)\\times D_{68}(M)^{\\mathbb N}}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{val}_{68}^{M}\\in D_{68}(M)^{\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)\\times D_{68}(M)^{\\mathbb N}}\\land\n\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\operatorname{Form}_{68}(\\sigma)\\times D_{68}(M)^{\\mathbb N}}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta[n\\mapsto d]:=(\\eta\\restriction(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{n\\}))\\cup\\{(n,d)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta[n\\mapsto d]:=(\\eta\\restriction(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{n\\}))\\cup\\{(n,d)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(v_{68}(n),\\eta):=\\eta(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(v_{68}(n),\\eta):=\\eta(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"j\\in J\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(f_{68}(j,\\vec t),\\eta):=\\phi(j)(\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(\\vec t(\\ell),\\eta):\\ell&lt;\\beta(j)\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[j\\in J\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(f_{68}(j,\\vec t),\\eta):=\\phi(j)(\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(\\vec t(\\ell),\\eta):\\ell&lt;\\beta(j)\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(eq_{68}(s,t),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(s,\\eta)=\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(t,\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(eq_{68}(s,t),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(s,\\eta)=\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(t,\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(r_{68}(i,\\vec t),\\eta)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(\\vec t(\\ell),\\eta):\\ell&lt;\\alpha(i)\\rangle\\in\\rho(i)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[i\\in I\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(r_{68}(i,\\vec t),\\eta)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(\\vec t(\\ell),\\eta):\\ell&lt;\\alpha(i)\\rangle\\in\\rho(i)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(neg_{68}(p),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(neg_{68}(p),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(b_{68}(5,p,q),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta)=1\\lor\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q,\\eta)=1\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(b_{68}(5,p,q),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta)=1\\lor\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q,\\eta)=1\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(b_{68}(6,p,q),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta)=1\\land\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q,\\eta)=1\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(b_{68}(6,p,q),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta)=1\\land\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q,\\eta)=1\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(b_{68}(7,p,q),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta)=0\\lor\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q,\\eta)=1\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(b_{68}(7,p,q),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta)=0\\lor\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q,\\eta)=1\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(b_{68}(8,p,q),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta)=\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q,\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(b_{68}(8,p,q),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta)=\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q,\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q_{68}(9,n,p),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta[n\\mapsto d])=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q_{68}(9,n,p),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta[n\\mapsto d])=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q_{68}(10,n,p),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta[n\\mapsto d])=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(q_{68}(10,n,p),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(p,\\eta[n\\mapsto d])=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;((p,\\eta),1)\\in\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;((p,\\eta),1)\\in\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原有有限签名、任意非空集合载体及全部语义递归方程。关系符号与函数符号的元数条件现在分别有完整量词作用域；即使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span>，函数解释仍必须满足每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta(j)\">\\(\\beta(j)\\)</span> 的元数要求。解释函数在存在量词中直接限定到函数空间，不对尚未确认为函数的候选对象求值。</p>\n<p>合法结构的语义图仍由唯一语法分析及良基递归确定。非法结构的语义图置空，只是为了让对任意候选结构使用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}\\)</span> 成为总谓词；它不扩展合法语义图的输入域。语法非法、赋值不在相应域或结构非法时，图中没有相应的值为 1 的项。下游理论的模型与后承可直接使用该成员谓词，避免先对未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}(p,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}(p,\\eta)\\)</span> 求值。</p>\n<p>空域仍被排除；零元函数、零元关系和变量更新的原有含义不变。原书来源位置沿用上传材料，本次没有重新取得其所称 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"83dddcd7f37b01bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-first-order-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"83dddcd7f37b01bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M,\\sigma$ 为候选集合。$\\operatorname{Signature}$、$\\operatorname{Term}_{68}$、$\\operatorname{Form}_{68}$ 和语法构造子见 [[68-df-first-order-syntax]]。$\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}$、$D_{68}$ 及语义函数图在下式引入；$\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta)$ 是对任意候选 $M,p,\\eta$ 定义的谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Signature}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Term}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Form}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"D_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"M,p,\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in D^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in\\operatorname{Form}_{68}(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in J","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)^{\\beta(j)}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)^{\\alpha(i)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{68}^{M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists I,J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^I\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^J\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)\\land\\operatorname{Signature}(\\sigma)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists D\\;\\left(D\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\exists\\rho\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal P(D^r)\\right)^I\\;\n\\exists\\phi\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}D^{D^r}\\right)^J\\;\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&M=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\rho(i)\\subseteq D^{\\alpha(i)})\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl(\\forall j\\in J\\;(\\phi(j)\\in D^{D^{\\beta(j)}})\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"D_{68}(M):=\\begin{cases}\nD&M=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi),\\ \\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma),\\\\\n\\varnothing&\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\;\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\;\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\bigr)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{val}_{68}^{M}=\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}=\\varnothing\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{val}_{68}^{M}\\in D_{68}(M)^{\\operatorname{Term}_{68}(\\sigma)\\times D_{68}(M)^{\\mathbb N}}\\land\n\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^{M}\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\operatorname{Form}_{68}(\\sigma)\\times D_{68}(M)^{\\mathbb N}}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta[n\\mapsto d]:=(\\eta\\restriction(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{n\\}))\\cup\\{(n,d)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(v_{68}(n),\\eta):=\\eta(n).","display":true},{"tex":"j\\in J\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(f_{68}(j,\\vec t),\\eta):=\\phi(j)(\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(\\vec t(\\ell),\\eta):\\ell<\\beta(j)\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sat}_{68}^M(eq_{68}(s,t),\\eta)=1\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(s,\\eta)=\\operatorname{val}_{68}^M(t,\\et